# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Signing material. NEVER commit any of this.
#
# A code signing certificate's private key identifies you as the publisher.
# Anyone holding it can sign software in your name. Keep it in a password
# manager or an offline backup, never in source control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.key
*.pfx
*.snk

# Exported code signing certificates. The public half (.cer) is safe to share
# but is generated per machine, so it is not tracked either.
*.cer
code-signing-backup.pfx
dist/app/PdfToDicom-2.1.0-win-arm64.exe
dist/app/PdfToDicom-2.1.0-win-x64.exe
dist/app/PdfToDicom-2.1.0-win-x86.exe
